              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રૂપરેખા — rūprekhā — \"an outline\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો રૂપરેખા તૈયાર હશે તો કામ ઝડપી થશે. jo rūprekhā taiyār haśe to kām jhaḍpī thaśe. If the outline is ready, the work will go faster."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રૂપરેખા (rūprekhā) is built from Sanskrit rūpa, \"form, shape\", and rekhā, \"a line\" (Monier-Williams): the lines of a shape."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
